Used in SHARX INVEST Android for JARVIS on the phone, for non-commercial use only.
Bundled unmodified: core/prompt.txt (as prompt.txt), memory/memory_manager.py, LICENSE, from the commit in COMMIT.
Changes made by SHARX at runtime (app/jarvis_phone.py): the prompt's [SELF] section describes the phone instead of the
desktop, the prompt's own '#' comment lines are not sent, and memory is stored in the SHARX data folder.
Tool names and parameters save_memory, recall_memory, weather_report, reminder and shutdown_jarvis follow Mark LVII.
